318,City Mayor's Office - PESO,cmo_pesos_job_fair,en,When is the next job fair?,"To participate in or inquire about a **Job Fair**, the Public Employment Service Office (PESO) is the main contact.

---
### 👔 Job Fair Participation

**Steps:**
1. Visit the PESO office or check the official City Government Facebook page for upcoming Job Fair announcements.
2. Prepare multiple copies of your Resume/Bio-data with recent 2x2 ID pictures.
3. Pre-register online or walk-in during the Job Fair day at the venue (usually the City Gym).
4. Proceed to the interview booths of your target companies.

💰 **Cost:** Completely Free.
⏱️ **Processing Time:** Same day interview.",Citizen Charter (Part 3),"pesos, job, fair"
319,City Mayor's Office - PESO,cmo_pesos_job_fair,en,How to join the city job fair?,"To participate in or inquire about a **Job Fair**, the Public Employment Service Office (PESO) is the main contact.

